<section class="cs-shell cs-book-console">
 <header class="cs-hero"><div><p class="cs-kicker">GM ONLY // BAY CITY 2384 // MODULE 1.3.0</p><h2>Cold Storage</h2><p>The Faces We Left Behind. Read G00, G01, G04 and G06 first.</p></div><div class="cs-hero-actions"><button data-action="importBook" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-book" aria-hidden="true"></i> Import / Update Book Only</button><button type="button" class="cs-primary" data-action="openContinuity"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain" aria-hidden="true"></i> Continuity &amp; Psychosurgery</button></div></header>
 <section class="cs-panel"><div class="cs-panel-head"><h3>Manual scene controls</h3><span>NO AUTOMATIC ROLLS OR EGO LOSS</span></div>
 <p>Start Heat 1. Start Renewal only after the three proofs are available. Advance once per complete operation round. Proof, Control and People each need two contributions.</p>
 <div class="cs-book-counters">{{#each counters}}<div><strong>{{label}}</strong><div><button type="button" data-action="count" data-key="{{key}}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Decrease {{label}}">−</button> <b>{{value}} / {{max}}</b> <button type="button" data-action="count" data-key="{{key}}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Increase {{label}}">+</button></div></div>{{/each}}</div>
 <div class="cs-book-fray">{{#each pcs}}<div><span>{{name}}</span><button type="button" data-action="count" data-key="fray" data-pc="{{id}}" data-delta="-1">-</button><b>{{fray}} / 6</b><button type="button" data-action="count" data-key="fray" data-pc="{{id}}" data-delta="1">+</button></div>{{/each}}</div>
 <p>Optional Fray starts at 2/3/4/5 for sleeves 5/6/7/8. Run the five checks and the once-only anchors in the Continuity Console; manual adjustments here do not deduct Ego. At six, ask the player to choose Integration, Partition or Shelter. Open the Core Clinical Console for actual psychosurgery.</p></section>
 <section class="cs-panel"><h3>The complete GM book</h3><div class="cs-book-links">{{#each chapters}}<button type="button" data-action="open" data-source="{{id}}">{{id}} - {{title}}</button>{{/each}}</div></section>
 <section class="cs-panel"><h3>Evidence props - not public until discovered</h3><p>Open to review, choose recipients, then reveal. Sharing grants journal access; it does not force the window onto a player's screen.</p>{{#each handouts}}<div class="cs-book-share"><button type="button" data-action="open" data-source="{{id}}">{{id}} - {{title}}</button><select data-recipient-for="{{id}}" aria-label="Recipients for {{id}}"><option value="">Choose recipients...</option><option value="everyone">All current players</option>{{#each ../users}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="reveal" data-source="{{id}}">Reveal</button></div>{{/each}}</section>
 <section class="cs-panel"><h3>Private character cards</h3><p>Grant only to the character's player. There is no all-players option.</p>{{#each cards}}<div class="cs-book-share"><button type="button" data-action="open" data-source="{{id}}">{{title}}</button><select data-recipient-for="{{id}}" aria-label="Recipient for {{id}}"><option value="">Choose a player...</option>{{#each ../users}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="reveal" data-source="{{id}}">Grant access</button></div>{{/each}}</section>
 <p class="cs-hint">The original relationship dashboard remains separate. A book-only update preserves existing PCs, items, relationship reveals, scene art and custom scene links. Changed source pages are retained in GM Recovery Copies before replacement.</p>
</section>
